  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The correct IUPAC name of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> is: </p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": " Potassium tetraoxopermanganate (VI) ",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Potassium tetraoxidomanganate (VI) ",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": " Dipotassium tetraoxidomanganate (VII) ",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Potassium tetraoxidomanganese (VI) ",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The structure of the IUPAC name is </p><p>name of cationic part + Name of anionic part.</p><p>Metal present in the anionic complex, so 'ate', must be added at the end of the metal name. </p><p>Oxidation state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>The structure of anionic complex name is</p><p>ligand names + metal name(oxidation state)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>–</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Oxidation state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mn</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>IUPAC Name is:</p><p>Potassium tetraoxidomanganate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>VI</mi></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
}